<title>USA: Inamed affected by breast implant suits.</title>
<headline>Inamed affected by breast implant suits.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inamed Corp said Friday breast implant litigation continues to be a drain on the company.</p>
<p>&quot;Regarding breast implant litigation and settlement issues, Inamed is one of the settling defendants in the revised settlement program and continues to pursue its objective of achieving mandatory (non-opt-out) class resolution,&quot; said chairman Donald McGhan.  &quot;In the meantime, litigation continues to be a drain on the company's finances, resources and management's time.&quot;</p>
<p>The company on Friday reorted second-quarter net income of $0.17 per share versus $0.15 per share in the same period a year earlier.</p>
